{"4582390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Internship", "steam_appid": 4582390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5059240], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome, Intern!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582390/extras/ad23af7f52d9c69ef28983198269e893.avif?t=1786477614\" width=1080 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve been hired as an IT intern at <strong>CorpCorp Incorporated</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your first shift, it quickly becomes clear that something is wrong. Your coworkers behave strangely and you fear you may not survive <strong>The Internship</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582390/extras/fe06d0e33e1e0789d9fddb092ea5797c.avif?t=1786477614\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582390/extras_big/fe06d0e33e1e0789d9fddb092ea5797c.webp?t=1786477614 width=1560 height=598 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Internship</strong> is a surreal office horror game where you must complete your daily “work,” monitor your coworkers’ strange behaviors, and uncover the truth hidden deep within CorpCorp Incorporated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thankfully, mAIsy the AI assistant, will be there every step of the way. We promise. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582390/extras/26d7a8e998eb1431fe36ad8c6f6c5564.avif?t=1786477614\" width=1080 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just another day in corporate America.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect from your internship</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a retro-style office computer system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack into coworkers' computers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive 1 week at CorpCorp Incorporated</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search files, read documents, and uncover hidden information</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance survival with investigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partner with <strong>mAIsy</strong>, CorpCorp’s friendly internal AI assistant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a surreal corporate horror mystery</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome, Intern!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582390/extras/ad23af7f52d9c69ef28983198269e893.avif?t=1786477614\" width=1080 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve been hired as an IT intern at <strong>CorpCorp Incorporated</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your first shift, it quickly becomes clear that something is wrong. Your coworkers behave strangely and you fear you may not survive <strong>The Internship</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582390/extras/fe06d0e33e1e0789d9fddb092ea5797c.avif?t=1786477614\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582390/extras_big/fe06d0e33e1e0789d9fddb092ea5797c.webp?t=1786477614 width=1560 height=598 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Internship</strong> is a surreal office horror game where you must complete your daily “work,” monitor your coworkers’ strange behaviors, and uncover the truth hidden deep within CorpCorp Incorporated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p 